    "Flèches en métal (Meteor Gorge)": ["Metal arrows (Meteor Gorge)", "Flechas de metal (Meteor Gorge)", "Frecce di metallo (Meteor Gorge)", "Metallpfeile (Meteor Gorge)"],
    "Chevrons (Assembly Lane)": ["Chevrons (Assembly Lane)", "Cheurones (Assembly Lane)", "Chevron (Assembly Lane)", "Winkelpfeile (Assembly Lane)"],
