    "Matériaux Blender → texture du jeu (taper pour chercher : rock, wood, palm… ; vide = roche du gabarit)": ["Blender materials → game texture (type to search: rock, wood, palm…; empty = template rock)", "Materiales de Blender → textura del juego (escribe para buscar: rock, wood, palm…; vacío = roca de la plantilla)", "Materiali Blender → texture del gioco (scrivi per cercare: rock, wood, palm…; vuoto = roccia del modello)", "Blender-Materialien → Spieltextur (tippen zum Suchen: rock, wood, palm…; leer = Vorlagen-Fels)"],
